# Requests for the Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST client.
# 1. Log in and copy the accessToken into @token.
# 2. Run the authenticated requests below.

@host = http://localhost:5243
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Log in
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search the Comic Vine catalog
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/search?query=berserk&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Import a volume into my collections
POST {{host}}/api/collections/import-comic-vine-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiDetailUrl": "https://comicvine.gamespot.com/api/volume/4050-18166/"
}

### My collections
GET {{host}}/api/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pending tomes across all collections
GET {{host}}/api/collections/pending-tomes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sync collections with Comic Vine
POST {{host}}/api/collections/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
